  },
  "sides": [
    {
      "id": "s_3d0cea3a",
      "name": "NATO",
      "tag": "NATO",
      "color": "#3d8bfd",
      "awareness": "Normal",
      "proficiency": "Regular",
      "computer_only": false,
      "start_score": 0,
      "doctrine": {
        "use_nuclear_weapons": "no",
        "weapon_control_status_air": "Tight"
      },
      "postures": {
        "s_2bea36ad": "H",
        "s_e2e978db": "N"
      },
      "briefing_html": "<h1>Situation</h1>\n<p>A Russian surface action group of two Steregushchiy corvettes and a Karakurt missile ship is in the eastern\nGulf of Finland, covered by Su-35S fighters and an S-400 battalion near Kingisepp.</p>\n\n<h1>Mission</h1>\n<p>Keep Allied airspace and the sea lanes open, and keep Russian warships away from Hogland.</p>\n\n<h1>Execution</h1>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Weapons tight in the air until the enemy shows hostile intent.</li>\n\t<li>Finnish F-35As can be readied after three hours (75% chance).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1>Command and Signal</h1>\n<p>+10 points per Russian unit destroyed, +1 every 30 minutes Hogland stays free.</p>",
      "export_briefing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s_2bea36ad",
      "name": "Russia",
      "tag": "RU",
      "color": "#e5484d",
      "awareness": "Normal",
      "proficiency": "Regular",
      "computer_only": false,
      "start_score": 0,
      "doctrine": {
        "use_nuclear_weapons": "no"
      },
      "postures": {
        "s_3d0cea3a": "H",
        "s_e2e978db": "N"
      },
      "briefing_html": "<h1>Situation</h1>\n<p>NATO has deployed Typhoons to Amari and Finnish Hornets are on alert at Rissala.</p>\n\n<h1>Mission</h1>\n<p>Show the flag in the Gulf of Finland and put warships off Hogland.</p>\n\n<h1>Execution</h1>\n<p>The strike on the Finnish patrol boat is released after four hours.</p>\n\n<h1>Command and Signal</h1>\n<p>+50 for reaching Hogland, +10 per NATO unit destroyed.</p>",
      "export_briefing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s_e2e978db",
